&gt;&lt;br&gt;
在浏览器URL改为：http://127.0.0.1/learn/learnfile.php?file=http://127.0.0.1/password.txt&lt;br&gt;
按回车执行password文件代码。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/phpchat2/2.11.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1070&#34;
	height=&#34;609&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/phpchat2/2.11_hu_d488106b29c64748.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/phpchat2/2.11_hu_8e9ff3da09adf04e.jpg 1024w&#34;
